 "doi": "10.5281/zenodo.15724261",
 "description": "<p>This dataset includes&nbsp;Foldseek results for the&nbsp;<em>S. rosetta</em> plastin 1 (<a href=\"https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/F2TWP3/entry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">F2TWP3</a>) and coronin 1a (<a href=\"https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/F2TZV2/entry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">F2TZV2</a>) homologs. It also includes inputs and outputs from <a href=\"https://dx.doi.org/10.57844/arcadia-a5a6-1068\">ProteinCartography</a> analysis of the <em>S. rosetta </em>homolog of the protein encoded by&nbsp;<em>DDC</em>&nbsp;(<a href=\"https://www.uniprot.org/uniprotkb/F2UCR6/entry\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">F2UCR6</a>).</p>\n<p>These data accompany the pub, \"<a href=\"https://doi.org/10.57844/arcadia-bp0f-v1xx\">Modeling human monogenic diseases using the choanoflagellate <em>Salpingoeca rosetta</em></a>.\"</p>",
